  "description": "New Relic observability intelligence for Claude Code. Investigate APM performance, analyze cloud costs, debug Kubernetes, write NRQL queries, and respond to alerts — all from your terminal using New Relic telemetry data.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **3 skills** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (3): `apm` (Application Performance Monitoring and transaction analysis), `finops` (Cloud FinOps cost analysis), `kubernetes` (Kubernetes diagnosis and debugging using New Relic telemetry)\n- **MCP servers** (1): `newrelic`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install newrelic@claude-plugins-official` from `newrelic/claude-code-plugin`.",
